  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFPRI-Research and Evidence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFPRI will be providing  analysis on strategic grain reserves and generating communication of evidence based policy research that will likely impact on food security in Malawi including those for the regulation of the agriculture sector, climate and disaster management, nutrition and social protection sectors. IFPRI is an independent, non profit global food policy research institution which delivers holist support for country led development by building evidence, tools and capacity for agricultural and food system transformation at country level.</narrative>
  </description>
